[{"title":"江东客中","author":"宋无","text":"诗人不是欠生涯，野性从前懒在家。\n冷眼春来元有分，看山看雪看梅花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"宋无","text":"遥天碧荡荡，远草绿愔愔。\n并作相思海，春来一样深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江南思","author":"宋无","text":"暮雨娥皇庙，春风西子城。\n相思行不得，更听鹧鸪声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"宋无","text":"莫折阊门杨柳条，带将离恨过枫桥。\n向道春愁不禁荡，兰舟长放橹轻摇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"老农","author":"宋无","text":"倩搔背痒坐深村，爱说前朝赐帛恩。\n县帖不来寻社长，自摊牛契教玄孙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"老将","author":"宋无","text":"杀气消磨暗铁衣，夜看太白剑无辉。\n旧时麾下谁相问，半去封侯半不归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"自君之出矣二首 其二","author":"宋无","text":"自君之出矣，妾自奉尊嫜。\n知君不思妾，亦当思故乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"自君之出矣二首 其一","author":"宋无","text":"自君之出矣，妾不出闺门。\n怀君不敢恨，惟有感君恩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖所见","author":"宋无","text":"绿阑干护水鳞鳞，苏小门前柳弄春。\n听得语声娇不见，隔帘佯唤卖花人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"访山中隐者","author":"宋无","text":"遥闻捣药声，知有幽人家。\n相寻却无路，又隔一溪花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吴中菊花盛开","author":"宋无","text":"菊花三百六十种，处处名园花不同。\n安得化身千百亿，一花著取一吟翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"旱乡田父言","author":"宋无","text":"疲牛病嚅饿桑间，碌碡间眠麦地乾。\n残税驱将儿子去，岂畦欲倩草人看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苏堤","author":"宋无","text":"汉苑花何处，唐陵柏已空。\n相逢大堤柳，令我忆苏公。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"阿房宫图","author":"宋无","text":"千门万户矗青冥，六国脂膏四海兵。\n岂但此中非帝业，当时犹更有儒坑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"岳阳夜泊图","author":"宋无","text":"长忆巴陵山水秋，老来看画却成愁。\n个中无听猿啼处，若听猿啼更泪流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":85,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"明皇卧吹箫图","author":"宋无","text":"珊瑚枕上玉箫横，一曲霓裳万里行。\n漫道九重宫殿远，几曾掩得外边声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":86,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杭州","author":"宋无","text":"锦绣波翻太液空，一池寒雨落芙蓉。\n内前尚有中官住，却听西蕃寺里钟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":87,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杭州","author":"宋无","text":"山势犹龙凤，行宫已劫灰。\n北人偏怅望，曾见汴京来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":88,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"郊外晚望","author":"宋无","text":"野旷行人少，林荒夕照微。\n烟中一声笛，何处牧儿归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":89,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金陵怀古","author":"宋无","text":"宫砖卖尽雨崩墙，苜蓿秋红满夕阳。\n玉树后庭花不见，北人租地种茴香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":90,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客夜思亲","author":"宋无","text":"老妻病女去淮西，慈母居吴鹤发衰。\n我独天涯听夜雨，寒灯三处照相思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":91,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宫人斜","author":"宋无","text":"步摇明月冷无光，骨掩春泥草亦芳。\n艳魄不随红粉尽，化为蝴蝶舞昭阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":92,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"宋无","text":"月照芙蓉水殿秋，仙韶一曲奏《凉州》。\n高皇尚爱梨园舞，宣索当年菊部头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":93,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春归","author":"宋无","text":"报道春归去，忙来看落红。\n岂知春不去，还在绿阴中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":94,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"宋无","text":"閒画金钗记远人，杜鹃啼血又残春。\n琵琶弦上无多字，近日相思弹不真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":95,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"祚德庙","author":"宋无","text":"祀典当时盛，忠曾保赵孤。\n谁知宋祚绝，今与庙俱无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":96,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送翟山人","author":"宋无","text":"圣代容高尚，山林隐去休。\n方知尧舜日，亦自有巢由。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":97,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐人四马卷 其二","author":"宋无","text":"簇仗回来玉勒閒，黄门牵向落花间。\n君王不爱长杨猎，嘶入春风十二闲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":98,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐人四马卷 其四","author":"宋无","text":"太仆新调试锦鞯，九重日色照连钱。\n春来兴庆池边路，偏称宫中软玉鞭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":99,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐人四马卷 其三","author":"宋无","text":"霜蹄踏月早朝回，尾弄红丝拂紫苔。\n日暖龙池初洗罢，尚方闻进御鞍来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":100,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐宫词补遗 其一","author":"宋无","text":"海内升平服四夷，远邦贡物尽珍奇。\n近颁手诏俱停罢，独许南方进荔枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":101,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐宫词补遗 其二","author":"宋无","text":"罢朝轻辇驻花边，催唤黄门住静鞭。\n三十六宫人笑语，上前争索洗儿钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":102,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐宫词补遗 其四","author":"宋无","text":"宫娥随驾蜀山回，春日还从内苑来。\n闻道上皇忧寝食，御前休报海棠开。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":103,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"唐宫词补遗 其三","author":"宋无","text":"昭阳仙仗五云中，遥听笙箫起碧空。\n夜半月明人望幸，君王自在广寒宫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":104,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"泰伯庙","author":"宋无","text":"古者吾夫子，曾称三让名。\n后来秦失鹿，刘项死相争。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":105,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浦口","author":"宋无","text":"浦口晚潮来，佳期那可待。\n浪急行兰舟，蘋花更难采。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":106,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"破窗","author":"宋无","text":"藓画虫丝纸半无，雨分钱点入棂疏。\n秋风吹得青灯灭，萤火飞来照读书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":107,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"荷钱","author":"宋无","text":"拾来虚费藕丝穿，暴富池塘积万千。\n人世不平如买得，夏天那有盖鸥眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":108,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蚕妇","author":"宋无","text":"缫得新丝白，将来织素缣。\n自惭非锦绮，尚被舞人嫌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":109,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄衣曲 其一","author":"宋无","text":"闻有宫袍赐，翻令闺意伤。\n良人在行伍，祇待妾衣裳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":110,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄衣曲 其二","author":"宋无","text":"征衣须早寄，遥忆藁砧寒。\n莫讶啼痕少，相思泪已乾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":111,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清明病中","author":"宋无","text":"少年令节醉花前，老病花前服药眠。\n自检铜人试榆火，午窗烧艾起新烟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":112,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔父","author":"宋无","text":"纫草成春服，汲湘供晚炊。\n人间风浪险，醉里几曾知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":113,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"萍","author":"宋无","text":"风波长不定，浪迹在天涯。\n莫怨身轻薄，前生是柳花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":114,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪夜有怀","author":"宋无","text":"雪压狐裘醉玉京，夜闻歌吹到天明。\n寒窗病起今头白，始听春蚕食叶声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":115,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"景灵宫","author":"宋无","text":"孟月祠原庙，都人忆故宫。\n当年驾幸处，乔木鸟呼风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":116,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游楞伽寺","author":"宋无","text":"萝径入苍霭，钟声来翠微。\n招提在何许，云外一僧归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":117,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"湖上意","author":"宋无","text":"晚过鸳鸯浦，无心唱《采莲》。\n莫嗔兰桨急，为要趁前船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":118,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"琵琶","author":"宋无","text":"一片相思木，声含古塞秋。\n琵琶是谁制，长拨别离愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":119,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"琵琶亭","author":"宋无","text":"听彻哀弦泪两行，香山居士未心降。\n当年杜老吞声哭，恨不相逢在曲江。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":120,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墙头杏花","author":"宋无","text":"红杏西邻树，过墙无数花。\n相烦问春色，端的属谁家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":121,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"骡网图","author":"宋无","text":"剑阁清调犯属车，网骡驮得荔支无。\n俗嫌尽史才情少，不作承平舞马图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":122,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"燕","author":"宋无","text":"衔得香泥去，花间日午时。\n玉人方睡起，莫讶卷帘迟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":123,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大涤山道士","author":"宋无","text":"童颜几寒暑，编叶当衣裳。\n琴古面无漆，柏枯身有香。\n树精为老仆，石髓作乾粮。\n不语坐松下，天风吹发凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":124,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书赵集贤诗翰后","author":"宋无","text":"九天宫阙郁嵯峨，公昔骑龙上大罗。\n文在玉堂多焕烂，泪经铜狄一滂沱。\n原陵禾黍悲酆镐，人物风流继永和。\n今日吴笺拜遗墨，只堪哀怨不堪歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":125,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"公子家","author":"宋无","text":"朱门当道拥高槐，拂晓鸣驺散乳鸦。\n红叱拨骄矜匼匝，黑昆崙黠解琵琶。\n姬将银蜡烧明月，犬带金铃卧落花。\n不信铜驼荆棘里，百年前是五侯家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":126,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"双陆","author":"宋无","text":"金缕纹桑斲局坚，红云倒浸一池莲。\n星环紫极无多点，月印银潢有两弦。\n行采砧声鸣素练，计筹花片落牙钱。\n个人惯受卑栖苦，长为归迟罚绮筵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":127,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句曲王尊师","author":"宋无","text":"不与俗人接，草堂云自封。\n有时鍊丹去，无处觅行踪。\n树暖猴扪虱，花香鹿养茸。\n曾期尸解后，终隐大茅峰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":128,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"旧内臣家老马","author":"宋无","text":"罢直奚官雪满腮，少年曾扈上之回。\n金砧戍削蹄多裂，玉秣辛酸齿半摧。\n苜蓿地閒春草遍，葡萄宫废野花开。\n病嘶破枥秋风夜，犹忆先朝较猎来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":129,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"观沈氏盆开双头莲花戏作","author":"宋无","text":"一枝倾国又倾城，笑并香腮百媚生。\n湘浦二妃窥宝镜，星宫双六下银泓。\n金波影俪婵娟巧，玉露心分沆瀣清。\n曾向鸳鸯屏上看，野花空得合欢名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":130,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"初夏别业","author":"宋无","text":"别墅清深无俗人，蛛丝窗户网游尘。\n绿阴镂日新欢夏，红雨鏖花故恼春。\n病去情怀逢酒恶，困来天气与茶亲。\n壁间乌帽长閒却，肯学陶家戴漉巾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":131,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"别惠上人","author":"宋无","text":"秋归虎溪月，携锡入云松。\n又向深山住，还闻古寺钟。\n出生供野鸟，持咒伏潭龙。\n好去东林下，吟看五老峰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":132,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李翰林墓 其二","author":"宋无","text":"一骑紫鲸去，空掩谢山茔。\n落月今谁吊，长庚夜自明。\n乾坤沈秀气，江水带哀声。\n天上多宫府，文章不可轻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":133,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"灵岩寺上方","author":"宋无","text":"霸业销沈烟树浓，吴王台殿梵王宫。\n屧廊人去土花碧，香径僧归秋叶红。\n飓母射岩风动地，蛟精徙穴雾迷空。\n明朝江郭重回首，寺在翠微苍霭中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":134,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"垂虹亭秋日遣兴","author":"宋无","text":"满袖玉皇香案烟，綵霓背上俯晴川。\n红黄霜树珊瑚海，黑白云花玳瑁天。\n玄圃空离楼十二，丹墀罢对字三千。\n吟豪醉蘸吴江水，写与骑鲸李谪仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":135,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"建业閒居春思","author":"宋无","text":"杜曲芳菲早，江城店舍烟。\n雨青榆荚地，风白柳花天。\n愁结丁香上，酲馀禁酒前。\n病多游冶少，春事亦留连。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":136,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金陵送倪水西之江陵","author":"宋无","text":"楚江江上暮云东，万里春波去意浓。\n桃叶歌残秣陵酒，梨花梦断景阳钟。\n沅湘水落琼瑶合，巴蜀山来锦绣重。\n回雁峰前见归雁，相思何处再相逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":137,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雨夜怀虚碧","author":"宋无","text":"共有烟霞疾，襟期江海分。\n故人年老别，寒雨夜深闻。\n地肺潜通岳，峨眉秀拂云。\n何时负笈去，稽首五千文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":138,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"青衣洞隐者","author":"宋无","text":"清泉自盥沐，丱发不冠巾。\n看尽世间事，争如林下人。\n啸云岩谷应，坐石鹿麋亲。\n莫弃茅庵去，白桃花又春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":139,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南峰宴坐僧","author":"宋无","text":"空岩槁木形，入定掩松扃。\n鹊供衔来果，猿看诵罢经。\n云霞埋衲重，苔藓上鞋青。\n只有樵人识，曾因采茯苓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":140,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春日野步书田家","author":"宋无","text":"翳日桤阴翠幄遮，葑围高下奕枰斜。\n陂塘几曲浅深水，桃李一溪红白花。\n赪尾自跳鱼放子，绿头相并鸭眠沙。\n春郊景物堪图写，输与烟樵雨牧家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":141,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送陈衡中之越","author":"宋无","text":"见说会稽郡，风流如晋时。\n贫惟将母去，清不要人知。\n修竹王猷宅，春风夏禹祠。\n到官游有暇，好寄剡中诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":142,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送宗上人游金陵","author":"宋无","text":"千峰乱水上，一榻到应分。\n古像焚香礼，寒钟出定闻。\n瓶离剑池月，锡入秣陵云。\n好去北山住，草堂休勒文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":143,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送葛鍊师远游","author":"宋无","text":"仙翁去醉碧桃春，鹤背风吹万里身。\n洞里棋高饶几子，瓢中诗好寄何人。\n三峰紫翠浮芒屩，五岳烟霞染葛巾。\n归日定知能缩地，莫教青竹化龙鳞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":144,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送谢士良之江东","author":"宋无","text":"谢安游赏去，别酒惜临分。\n万里甘为客，三春苦送君。\n风帆攲逆水，江树入空云。\n若过青山下，须题李白坟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":145,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秣陵晚眺","author":"宋无","text":"天堑鸿流拥积沙，石城虎踞漫雄誇。\n山陵青草六朝地，巷陌乌衣百姓家。\n紫盖黄旗消王气，琼枝璧月吊庭花。\n孤云更作降幡势，目断楼船日又斜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":146,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄郴阳廖有大","author":"宋无","text":"远宦身安不，题书泪几行。\n千山万水路，一日九回肠。\n鶗鴂怀春语，蘼芜入梦香。\n王孙归未得，归得早还乡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":147,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄钱翼之","author":"宋无","text":"作赋拟相如，何人诵子虚。\n琴弹中散操，扇玩右军书。\n北阙青云近，南冠白发疏。\n烦君传遗逸，著我入樵渔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":148,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]